# not rendered as Markdown: they use `*` bullets, `====` dividers and hanging
# indentation on purpose. A Markdown formatter rewrites all three, so it is kept
# away from them. Both oxfmt (the repo's formatter, via the pre-commit hook) and
# prettier read this file.
ai/**/*.md
pm/prompts/*.md

